text = "Controls:
• Right-Mouse Drag: Orbit / Fly Camera
• Left-Mouse Click & Drag: Grab and pull rope/cloth particles in real-time
• Middle-Mouse Click: Snip rope or tear cloth under cursor
• WASD / Space / Q: Fly camera navigation
• 'B' or Space: Fire rolling physics sphere
• 'W': Toggle wind gust generator | 'R': Reset simulation"
